@base = https://localhost:7081
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshToken = REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN
@recipientWalletId = REPLACE_WITH_BOB_WALLET_ID
@password = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DEMO_PASSWORD

### Login (after demo seeding)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.test","password":"{{password}}"}

### Own wallet
GET {{base}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transfer. Repeat with the SAME key and payload to replay safely.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipientWalletId":"{{recipientWalletId}}","amount":500.00}

### History
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rotate refresh token ONCE; replace both saved tokens with the response.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Database readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready
